    },
    {
      "source_split": "official_train",
      "source_key": "line_14529",
      "text": "公布为世界受威胁植物红录,被宣告灭绝。"
    },
    {
      "source_split": "official_train",
      "source_key": "line_13518",
      "text": "量和可开发利用的钴资源储量均居国内首位。"
    },
    {
      "source_split": "official_train",
      "source_key": "line_17607",
      "text": "人收。新鬼烦冤旧鬼哭,天阴雨湿声啾啾。"
    },
    {
      "source_split": "official_train",
      "source_key": "line_7804",
